# Rodel - Unified Everyday Purchase Timeline (3-Slot Sandwich Pattern)
# Shifts ONLY on meaningful story flags (Flag_RodelRememberedAnito / Flag_RodelSubWater).
# Voice: Courteous, slightly formal Ilokano Litao water anito. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
# Slot 1: P1-P3 Reactive Opener or High-Price Remark
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Rodel: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
elif {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	Rodel: Steep tide on your price tags, keeper. I shall measure my coins with care.

# Slot 2: Upfront Utang Ask OR Flag-Driven Request Pool (4 grounded variations per state)
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Rodel: Pardon me, keeper. I reached for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] and brought smooth sea shells instead of paper pesos.
	Rodel: Might you record my name in your lista until my next walk up from the creek?
	- Sure Rodel, on the lista.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		Rodel: Salamat, keeper. Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever your hands are free.
	- Sorry Rodel, cash only right now.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		Rodel: Fair custom, keeper. I shall return to the bamboo clump for proper inland coins.
elif {Flag_RodelRememberedAnito}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Rodel: Dayu-dayu, keeper. Calm breeze down by the creek bamboo. May I get [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Rodel: Two neighbors greeted me by name on the walk over. Let me buy [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please.
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Rodel: Your counter feels like a steady shore, keeper. Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	else:
		Rodel: Exact inland coins ready on the wood. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], salamat.
elif {Flag_RodelSubWater}:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Rodel: Your cold shelves ease this dry concrete road, keeper. May I purchase [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Rodel: Dayu-dayu, keeper. Stopping up from the creek for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Rodel: Still marveling at your neat inland packaging. Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please.
	else:
		Rodel: Polite greeting to the counter. Let me take [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
else:
	if {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 25:
		Rodel: Dayu-dayu, keeper. Dry crossing from the creek. May I buy [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 50:
		Rodel: Pardon the damp hem, keeper. I am hoping for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
	elif {Transaction_GreetingVar} < 75:
		Rodel: Your shelves are neatly kept. Pass me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] when you are ready.
	else:
		Rodel: Inland coins counted properly this pass. [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], please.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
Rodel: No hurry, keeper. Still hoping for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] whenever your hands are free.
- Coming right up, Rodel.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry Rodel, we're out of stock.
	Rodel: Even full rivers run shallow at times. I shall check back another pass.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	Rodel: Salamat, keeper. Still waiting politely on [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	Rodel: Received with thanks. Just [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] remaining.
else:
	Rodel: Fine start. Take your time with [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], keeper.
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	Rodel: Salamat, keeper. Spell Litao cleanly beside my name on your lista.
else:
	if {Global_TipActive}:
		Rodel: Fair measure deserves fair return. Please keep the extra coins, keeper.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 34:
		Rodel: Salamat, keeper. May calm water keep your house steady.
	elif {Transaction_SatisfyVar} < 67:
		Rodel: Just what I hoped for. Back to the bamboo shade I go.
	else:
		Rodel: Always courteous service behind this wood. Thank you, keeper.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Repayment
Rodel: Proper inland currency first, keeper. Here is the {Transaction_RepaymentAmount} pesos from your lista.
- Thanks, Rodel. All settled.
	[signal arg="repay_debt"]
	Rodel: Clean slate, like smooth sand after high tide. Salamat.
- Keep it, Rodel. On the house.
	[signal arg="forgive_debt"]
	Rodel: Wait, truly? Inland hospitality runs deeper than I guessed. Salamat, keeper.
- No rush, Rodel. Next pass.
	[signal arg="defer_repay"]
	Rodel: Patient as a deep current. I shall keep these pesos dry until next visit.
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
Rodel: Pardon me, keeper, I believe I asked for [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color].
[end_timeline]
